	<div id="collection_page">
				<div id="collection_page_head">
		<h4>DINOLAND　DINOSAURUS MODEL COLLECTION<br />
		1/35 スケールソフトビニールキット　ステゴサウルス</h4>
			<p>
			原型制作：山下伸一<br />
			DINOLAND初期は<a href="../../../masterarts/etc/index.html">原さん、山下さん</a>、そして<a href="../../../masterarts/araki">荒木先生</a>の3名がラインナップを支えていたようです。<br />
			こちらもおそらく初期のものでしょう。首の曲がり方にレトロ感を感じますが、互い違いに並んだ骨板など、現在の復元とそんなに変わらないような気がします。<br />
					</p>
		</div>
		<div id="collection_page_main">
		
			<table style="width: 100%">
				<tr>
					<td colspan="2">
					<img height="357" src="img/stego012.jpg" width="756" /></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td class="comment" colspan="2">
					全パーツ。パッケージは無かったため不明。組み立て図はありませんが、1/20ティラノサウルスにも付いていた「<a href="../20tyrannosaurs/img/tyrannobook1_s.jpg">組み立て方</a>」は付属していました。</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/stego002.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/stego002_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35stegosaurs/img/stego002.jpg" --></a></td>
					<td>
					<a href="img/stego003.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/stego003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35stegosaurs/img/stego003.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/stego005.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/stego005_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35stegosaurs/img/stego005.jpg" --></a></td>
					<td>
					<a href="img/stego004.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/stego004_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35stegosaurs/img/stego004.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td class="comment" colspan="2">
					頭、首、胴体はワンパーツ。骨板の穴には番号が書いてあります。</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/stego006.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/stego006_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35stegosaurs/img/stego006.jpg" --></a></td>
					<td>
					<a href="img/stego007.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/stego007_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35stegosaurs/img/stego007.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td class="comment" colspan="2">
					尻尾。</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/stego008.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/stego008_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35stegosaurs/img/stego008.jpg" --></a></td>
					<td>
					&nbsp;</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/stego009.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/stego009_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35stegosaurs/img/stego009.jpg" --></a></td>
					<td>
					<a href="img/stego010.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/stego010_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35stegosaurs/img/stego010.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/stego011.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/stego011_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35stegosaurs/img/stego011.jpg" --></a></td>
					<td>
					<a href="img/stego013.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/stego013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35stegosaurs/img/stego013.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td colspan="2" class="comment">
					骨板とスパイクパーツは左右対照ではないため、きちんと番号が振られています。</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td colspan="2">
					<a href="../../../masterarts/etc/img/stego001.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="../../../masterarts/etc/img/stego001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/masterarts/etc/img/stego001.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td class="comment" colspan="2">
					完成品は<a href="../../../go_out/kaiyodo_nagoya/kaiyodo_nagoya1.html">名古屋に来たことがあります</a>。</td>
